      <description>&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;全文为&lt;a href=&#34;https://lilianweng.github.io/posts/2024-04-12-diffusion-video/&#34;&gt;Weng, Lilian. (Apr 2024). Diffusion Models Video Generation. Lil’Log.&lt;/a&gt;的中文翻译版本。&lt;/p&gt;
